NanoKVM-RS - Rust Implementation of NanoKVM Server
==================================================

Copyright (c) 2024-2025 NanoKVM-RS Contributors

This project is a Rust reimplementation of the NanoKVM server software,
originally written in Go by Sipeed.

ATTRIBUTION AND CREDITS
-----------------------

### Original NanoKVM Project

This project is based on and inspired by:

- **NanoKVM** by Sipeed
  - Repository: https://github.com/sipeed/NanoKVM
  - License: GPL-3.0
  - Copyright (c) Sipeed

The original NanoKVM project provided the reference implementation and
architecture that this Rust port is based upon.

### Hardware Libraries (dl_lib/)

The binary libraries in the `dl_lib/` directory are provided by:

- **Sipeed** (https://sipeed.com) - NanoKVM hardware manufacturer
- **Sophgo/Cvitek** - SG2002 SoC vendor

These libraries are distributed as part of the NanoKVM project and are
required for hardware video capture functionality.

### Third-Party Rust Crates

This project uses various open-source Rust crates. See Cargo.toml for
the complete list. Notable dependencies include:

- **axum** - Web framework (MIT)
- **tokio** - Async runtime (MIT)
- **webrtc** - WebRTC implementation (MIT/Apache-2.0)
- **serde** - Serialization (MIT/Apache-2.0)

